<i>The rising new star of this island</i>

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.080
<i>Everyone's chiming in to just say</i>

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.200
<i>Now, get on your feet, dauntlessly</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.500
<i>Once you grab the microphone, naturally</i>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.330
<i>We're going to go wild, so check it out</i>

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.690
<i>For tonight, the very best dinner</i>

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.660
<i>Words going beyond even the color of skin</i>

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.290
<i>This universal vibration</i>

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.110
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:55.580
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.780
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>Before the time comes
when there's no turning back</i>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.250
<i>Let's turn things in a positive direction</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:13.830
<i>If you don't take action,
you won't get anywhere</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.160
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.510
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.540
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.700
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.910
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.040
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.910
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.950
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.250
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.050
Ikedaya

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.330
Mr. Okita!

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:55.080
Chapter 1 Cherry Blossoms

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:02.910
Tetsu! Hey, wait!

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.370
Shinsengumi Recruiting Ronin...
Shinsengumi Commander, Isami Kondo

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.450
Move, move, move,
move, move, move, move!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:08.790
Hey...

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.460
Don't space out walking in the
middle of the road, you moron!

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:13.960
What?

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:19.410
I'm very sorry about that.
He's still only a child.

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:22.540
I don't know who you might be,
but I'm his elder brother.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:23.720
For my sake, please forgive him.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.800
Hey, Tetsu!

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.890
If not the middle, where the
heck am I supposed to walk?

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:39.490
Hello, there!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:41.990
Who the hell are you?!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:46.530
I'm Tetsunosuke Ichimura!
I came to join the Shinsengumi!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.490
Came to join us?

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.620
Hey, you! The notice board!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.750
Hold it, hold it, hold it!
Who said you could go in?!

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:59.000
Let go! It says you're recruiting
members right here, doesn't it?!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.300
It says, "seeking those who wish to
serve their country wholeheartedly"!

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.300
You read well for a brat.

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:08.200
Maybe you can read,
but you can't hide your age.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.640
We'll let you join up in another
five years. Okay, Shorty?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.730
Who are you calling Shorty?!

00:04:16.910 --> 00:04:19.750
I've been listening, and you've
called me a brat and a shorty!

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.530
Is that any way to speak to a
youth with noble aspirations?!

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.610
Oh, no!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.160
I'm fifteen! Remember that!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.980
Where's Captain Harada?

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.120
We have a message from the Second Unit.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.410
The location is on Kiyamachi Street,
near the Sanjo Kobashi Bridge.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.790
About five or six people.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:45.010
Don't let the Second Unit beat us to it!

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.540
Tenth Unit moving out!

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.100
Yeah!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:10.620
Shinsengumi

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:08.080
Sirs, we are sorry
to have troubled the both of you!

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.750
You know...

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:19.040
you're about the only idiot who'd
pick a fight with the Shinsengumi.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.200
Leave me alone.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.660
Why are you so hung up about this?

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:25.630
The Shinsengumi's nothing
but a group of murderers.

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:28.120
You were just lucky today.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:32.220
You keep this up and you'll
really end up dying on a sword.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.370
That's all fine and good for you, Tatsu.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.730
You're going to be a member of
the Shinsengumi starting tomorrow.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:47.410
As a bookkeeper. Just an abacus warrior.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.450
Come on, Tetsu, take my advice.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.950
If you want to become stronger,
there are training halls everywhere.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.410
Don't join up there. It won't suit you.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.420
Then what the heck am I supposed to do?!

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:02.160
Are you going to avenge
our dad with your abacus?!

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:05.670
Are you going to be able to fight
a Choshu clansman like that?!

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.010
Tetsu...

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:10.160
I want to become strong!

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.030
If I'd been strong that time...

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:23.850
Tetsu...

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:31.120
You are actually a great man.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:37.290
Japan is about to change greatly.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.290
It will surely be an era of chaos.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:40.890
You should...

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.210
become a peacemaker.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.710
Peace... maker?

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.060
Here.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.610
Fetch!

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:20.910
You there.

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:24.960
Are you all right?

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.700
Why, you...

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:34.970
You're just a pig! You've got
some nerve tackling me!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.540
What's your problem?

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.930
You look like a piggy bank!
I'll just eat you!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.370
Ow! Leggo!

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:44.940
Ow, that hurts!

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:55.620
Come now, they've brought the
tea out. Please help yourselves.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:59.740
Thank you so much. You didn't
have to go to such lengths for us...

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.910
Hey, Tetsu!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.250
I am so sorry for what happened.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.670
Hey, Saizo, you should also apologize!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:13.000
Oh, no, not after you've treated us...

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.590
Will you still not forgive us?

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:18.750
Or did someone pick on you?

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.680
Like the Wolves of Mibu?

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:27.120
So that's it, then.

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:31.030
If you have something you wish to
say to them, I could introduce you.

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:35.450
You want to join the Shinsengumi, right?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:39.620
You're so honest,
it's written all over your face.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.790
Well, then, shall we go?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.250
Where?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.080
To the training hall.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:48.500
People who wish to join
must first pass a test.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:52.670
I have some acquaintances there,
so I will do you a favor and ask them.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.170
All right!

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.550
What will you do when you
get to the training hall?

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:00.000
Well, then, I'm gonna beat the
famous genius swordsman, Soji Okita,

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.250
and send him... brawling!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.560
That's "sprawling," you idiot.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:06.830
Oh, right!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.240
It's real training!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.080
Excuse me!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.710
Has anyone seen Mr. Kondo?

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.040
Mr. Kondo...

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.760
Surely he doesn't mean the Commander...

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.630
Mr. Kondo!

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:40.330
Honestly! More training again today?

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:44.060
You haven't played with me recently,
so it's been really boring!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.560
What's this? It's the middle of
the day and you're already drunk?

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:53.370
Oh, Commander, that boy over
there apparently wants to join up.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:58.860
Well, Tetsu, Tatsu, good luck.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.540
Wanting to fight against Soji is
an admirable wish for a whelp.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.040
So, what do you plan to do
if you win against Soji?

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:12.200
Sir, I'll become the strongest man in Japan

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:16.630
and cut and slash and chop
the despicable Choshu!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:17.880
Oh-ho...

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:19.220
Tetsu!

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.550
Weren't you...?

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:26.580
Sir, I signed on just today and
my name is Tatsunosuke Ichimura.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:29.580
Tetsunosuke here is my younger brother,

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:34.250
and I beg that you forgive his rude behavior.
Someone, lend him your protectors!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.600
Hurray!

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.450
Thank you for waiting.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.160
First Unit Captain, Soji Okita.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.080
Pleased to meet you, Tetsu.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.170
Is this for real?!

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.080
From the look on your face,

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.010
I see you haven't forgotten that you
said you would send me sprawling.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:02.790
Of course not!

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:06.310
I'll defeat you and join the Shinsengumi!

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.310
This is bad... This is bad, Tetsu!

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:22.450
Tetsu, you won't defeat me like that.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:23.950
Damn it!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:29.330
Face! Body! Wrist!

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.120
Ow...

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.250
I'm not finished yet!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:38.170
That's no good.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.540
If you play the one-trick pony,

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.930
your opponent will see right through you.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.420
Tetsu...

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.690
Please, Commander!
Please make them stop already!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:12:00.160
That whelp's doing pretty well for himself.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.210
Man, it's hot!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.000
Hey, Susumu!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.170
Thanks for your hard work!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:23.800
What's that over there?

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.970
A Shinsengumi hopeful, looks like.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:41.190
Whoops.

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.360
Stop, Tetsu!

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.830
I can't win if I just keep going like this.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.500
I need to set up some kind of secret plan.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.500
That's enough...

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.910
I more than understand how you feel now,

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:59.790
so let's end it here for today and go home.

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:00.880
Okay, Tetsu?

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:05.630
Tatsu, hand me another bamboo sword!

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.980
Jikishin Two-Sword Style
Ultimate Technique!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:29.950
What a racket.

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:33.080
Yamazaki, what's going on?

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:37.330
Sir, it appears to be a
Shinsengumi hopeful.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:40.420
Some boy named Tetsunosuke Ichimura.

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:41.420
Ichimura?

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.300
He is sparring with Master Okita.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.620
Fool...

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.260
He's going to die.

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:51.760
Hey, a two-sword style!

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.870
<i>He really is an interesting boy.</i>

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:58.730
<i>Now, how will he come at me...?</i>

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.290
So, your younger brother
uses a two-sword style!

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.940
Well, that is...

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.110
Shadow Turning!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.950
<i>First, he'll try a standard
frontal blow from the right.</i>

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:15.830
<i>Which means, next will come a
blow to the body from the left.</i>

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:38.310
Are you done already, Tetsu?

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:39.690
Not yet!

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.820
He's changed his stance. That stance is...

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:49.240
Tennen Risshin Style, Hiraseigan!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:49.990
Here I come!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.110
Don't, Tetsu!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.460
Tetsu!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.120
<i>It's the same. It's those eyes...</i>

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.500
<i>Those eyes...</i>

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:30.350
<i>Am I going to lose to them again?</i>

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:34.200
Hang in there!

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.380
Tetsu... Hey!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:38.700
Damn it...

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.330
It's over.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.520
No, not yet.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.710
Not yet.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.270
I can't lose yet.

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:06.160
Tetsu!

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.530
<i>This man...</i>

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.540
What are you doing, you brat?!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:22.840
Soji, how many times have you done this?!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.710
I'm sorry.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.380
Tetsu, are you okay?

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:35.250
Splendid, Tetsunosuke! Well done!

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.430
I'm sure you'll do admirably here!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.640
I can sign on?!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:43.690
No.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:47.130
Why not, Toshi?!

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.980
We don't need whelps. Nor weaklings.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:55.120
Why not?! I haven't lost yet!

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:57.950
Let me try again! Come on!

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:00.200
It'll be the same no matter
how many times you try.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.750
You won't learn the sword of vengeance.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.720
Sword of vengeance...

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:29.410
I got scolded by Mr. Hijikata.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:34.040
He said, "Soji, when will you
learn to be more prudent?!"

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.490
I'm such a dangerous guy, aren't I?

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.660
It doesn't bother me.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.620
Actually, I was happy
you took me seriously.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.500
Tetsu, who do you want to avenge?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.330
How did you know?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.980
Because your eyes looked
incredibly desperate.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:56.040
I saw...

00:17:56.830 --> 00:18:01.390
Those eyes that I remember
and your face overlapped, and...

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:09.690
When I thought of how weak I am,
I just couldn't stand it!

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.980
I want to grow stronger and...

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:22.720
Were we so alike, he and I?

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.660
You said you were going to exact revenge.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:30.750
For that purpose, could you abandon
everything, even your humanity?

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:35.170
For that purpose, would you
fear nothing, even demons?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:39.680
I will defeat them.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.300
Very well.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.760
Then I shall give you
some useful information.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.250
Around the time of the Dog,

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:53.790
hide along the path next to
Wachigaiya in Shimabara.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:57.690
You are sure to see what
Mr. Hijikata meant by his words.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:03.990
Aren't they just sublime,
these night cherry blossoms?

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:06.910
I just had to see them
tonight in your company.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.750
Is that so?

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:13.590
But they say cherry blossoms are
most beautiful when they're scattering.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.090
My, you are such an awful man.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:23.140
But that's what I love about you,
Vice Commander Hijikata.

00:19:32.450 --> 00:19:35.000
Toshizo Hijikata?!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.030
What if I am?

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:39.360
Damn Shogunate dog!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:41.860
Mr. Hijikata!

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:00.290
That was quite a performance.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:03.970
Please have mercy...

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:07.660
For a clansman you fell in love with?

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:14.560
You bastard! Damn you for killing Omitsu!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.840
Tetsu, are you hurt at all?

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:41.340
Why?

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.160
We knew everything.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:48.550
That the Choshu were going to use
a woman to ambush Mr. Hijikata.

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:52.320
Brat, if you don't
understand, I'll tell you.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:59.610
The only thing you'll learn
here is how to be a demon.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:48.700
I will become Tetsunosuke Ichimura
of the Shinsengumi.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
<i>Gripping the microphone tight,
the hit parade's on parade</i>

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.470
<i>Hey, Jimmy, how you feeling?</i>

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:15.790
<i>Quite the gentleman when he's off stage</i>

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.480
